e evidence; older passing native/security checks retain their original scopes. All318 app-target and138 helper-target dependency notice entries have zero gaps, with matching complete source/relink delivery.\n\nThe two bare IPAs remain unsigned candidates. Native setup signs locally with the existing Xcode identity; no Apple credentials or signing keys are in these downloads. Actual Remote Pairing connection, in-app signing/install/update/refresh/recovery and physical Duo display/touch/fold acceptance remain unverified. This release stays private/unpublished and release_ready=false. The two original InstallationCheck fixture assets are unchanged.\n"}